  "historyNote": "#4412, eff 4-27-88; ss by #5093, eff 3-15-91, EXPIRED: 3-15-97 New. #6757, eff 5-27-98; ss by #8639, INTERIM, eff 5-27-06, EXPIRES: 11-23-06; ss by #8757, eff 11-17-06; ss by #10706, INTERIM, eff 11-15-14, EXPIRES: 5-14-15; ss by #10819, eff 4-23-15, EXPIRED: 4-23-25 New. #14352, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25, EXPIRES: 2-22-26",
